AcquisitionMethod: data dependent acquisition
AlkylationReagent: iodoacetamide
AnatomicSiteTumor: resected prostate cancer tissue specimens
CellPart: urinary EV (uEV)
CellPart: extracellular vesicles (EV)
CellPart: EV separated from prostate tumour conditioned medium
CleavageAgent: Trypsin/Lys-C mix
CollisionEnergy: normalized collision energy of 27%
Disease: prostate cancer
Disease: benign prostate hyperplasia
Disease: urothelial cancer of the bladder
Disease: renal cell carcinoma
DiseaseTreatment: radical prostatectomy
DiseaseTreatment: intensity-modulated radiation therapy
FactorValue: prostate cancer
